    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval is seeking an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in municipal agents daily missions, with a focus on improving efficiency and quality of service. an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions, with a focus on improving efficiency and quality of service must integrate with existing systems, ensure data sovereignty, and comply with regulatory requirements such as GDPR." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message2> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are the key components of The City of Belval tender response that will address the key components of our tender response that will address these needs and ensure a coherent proposal and ensure a coherent proposal?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message2> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval is seeking an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in municipal agents daily missions, with a focus on improving efficiency and quality of service. an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions, with a focus on improving efficiency and quality of service must integrate with existing systems, ensure data sovereignty, and comply with regulatory requirements such as GDPR." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are the key components of our tender response that will address these needs and ensure a coherent proposal?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, the key components of our tender response that will address these needs and ensure a coherent proposalould include our expertise in AI solutions, public sector IT, and smart cities. our can leverage our experience in implementing digital transformation projects, such as the digital workplace transformation for Comune di Torino and the AI-powered document management system for Regione Lombardia.  our proposal will highlight our ability to integrate with existing systems of information, business softwares, and electronic management of documents, ensuring continuity of file processing between agents and services. our will also emphasize our commitment to data sovereignty, hosting data exclusively on European Union territory, and protecting data using encryption and anonymization as necessary." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our will address the regulatory requirements, such as GDPR compliance, and ensure that our solution is designed with security and low carbon impact in mind. our change management capabilities, including training delivery and user adoption tracking, will also be essential in supporting the municipal agents during the implementation phase." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By showcasing our relevant experience, technical expertise, and understanding of the public sector's specific needs, our can submit a coherent proposal that meets The City of Belval requirements and constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The proposed solution requires integration with existing business software (civil status, town planning), electronic management of documents (EDM), and user directories, with API-type interfaces." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message4> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The system must provide times of response lower than 2 seconds and guarantee high availability (99.9%)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message4> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can our technical architecture meet these requirements while ensuring data sovereignty and compliance with SecNumCloud or equivalent infrastructure?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message4> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The proposed solution requires integration with existing business software (civil status, town planning), electronic management of documents (EDM), and user directories, with API-type interfaces." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The system must provide times of response lower than 2 seconds and guarantee high availability (99.9%)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can our technical architecture meet these requirements while ensuring data sovereignty and compliance with SecNumCloud or equivalent infrastructure?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., has experience in cloud architecture, API integration, and cybersecurity, which are essential for meeting The proposed solution requirements. our can design a technical architecture that integrates with existing business software, EDM, and user directories using API-type interfaces, such as REST or GraphQL, which are part of our API standards expertise." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure high availability and fast response times, our can leverage our experience with containerization using Docker and Kubernetes (K8s), as well as our knowledge of monitoring tools like Prometheus and Grafana. our can also utilize our expertise in identity providers, such as Active Directory / LDAP and Keycloak, to manage user directories and ensure secure access." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For data sovereignty and compliance with SecNumCloud or equivalent infrastructure, our have experience with cloud providers that offer high security standards, such as Outscale (SecNumCloud) and OVHcloud. our can design the architecture to host data exclusively on the territory of the European Union, using encryption and anonymization if necessary, to protect data in an appropriate manner." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our experience with IaC tools like Terraform and Ansible can help our ensure that the infrastructure is set up correctly and consistently, while our knowledge of security design patterns, including network, encryption, and authentication, can guarantee a high level of security for the system." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, our technical architecture can meet The proposed solution requirements while ensuring data sovereignty and compliance with SecNumCloud or equivalent infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval emphasizes the importance of data sovereignty, with hosting on EU territory, no data transfer outside EU, and protection of sensitive data through encryption or anonymization." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also comply with GDPR and ensure explicability and transparency of recommendations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
