    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security measures can we implement to address the importance of data sovereignty, with hosting on EU territory, no data transfer outside the EU, and protection of sensitive data through encryption or anonymization and demonstrate we commitment to regulatory compliance? we can implement several security measures to address The City of Belval concerns about data sovereignty and regulatory compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given we ISO 27001 certification, which includes the scope of design, development, and operation of AI-powered information systems, we can ensure that The solution is designed with security and compliance in mind." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To protect sensitive data, we can utilize anonymization tools such as Microsoft Presidio or custom NER models to ensure that personal data is not used in training pipelines without proper anonymization. we experience with GDPR compliance also means we can implement data subject rights, including access, rectification, erasure, portability, and objection, ensuring that The solution handles user data responsibly." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Moreover, we standard data residency policy ensures that data is stored within EU only, aligning with The City of Belval requirement for hosting on EU territory. we also have a cross-border transfer policy that prohibits transfers outside EU unless there is an explicit legal basis, further ensuring data sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To comply with GDPR and ensure explicability and transparency of recommendations, we can conduct Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIA) as needed, given we capability to perform such assessments within an average duration of 3 weeks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This will help identify and mitigate any risks associated with the processing of personal data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we experience with regulatory frameworks such as RGPD/GDPR, EU AI Act, RGS v2 (ANSSI), SecNumCloud, NIS2 Directive, and eIDAS demonstrates we commitment to compliance and we ability to navigate complex regulatory environments." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging these capabilities and experiences, we can implement a solution that not only meets but exceeds The City of Belval expectations for data sovereignty, security, and regulatory compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict compliance with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, and emphasizes the need for explicability and transparency of recommendations." ;
