        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, the legal risks that should be flagged in The tender include compliance with GDPR regulations, ensuring explicability and transparency of recommendations, and avoiding automated decisions without explicit agent validation.  we have experience with GDPR compliance as indicated by we standard legal basis being Article 6(1)(e) and we Data Protection Agreement template version being v3.2. we also have a no copyleft GPL contamination policy and ensure client data ownership." ;
