    <http://example.org/node/chunk162> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components and strategies can we propose to address these needs and provide a cutting-edge solution? we can propose we expertise in large language models, specifically we preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, which is an EU-origin model with strong French-language performance and self-hostable capabilities." ;
