    <http://example.org/node/chunk163> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To reduce energetic consumption, we can leverage we knowledge of quantisation methods such as INT8, INT4 (GPTQ), and GGUF to optimize our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, which is an EU-origin model with strong French-language performance and self-hostable capabilities energy usage. we experience in fine-tuning methods like LoRA, QLoRA, and full fine-tune on domain corpus can also help improve our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, which is an EU-origin model with strong French-language performance and self-hostable capabilities performance while minimizing our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, which is an EU-origin model with strong French-language performance and self-hostable capabilities carbon footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk164> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we research topics include knowledge graphs for procedural reasoning and multi-agent collaboration frameworks, which can be applied to develop innovative solutions that meet The City of Belval requirements." ;
