    <http://example.org/node/chunk165> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By utilizing these AI components and strategies, we can provide a cutting-edge solution that demonstrates innovation capacity while reducing energetic consumption and relying on low-carbon impact infrastructures." ;
