    <http://example.org/node/chunk170> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the CSR & Sustainability Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., the CSR & Sustainability Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can propose several sustainability measures that align with Nexus Engineering S.r.l. capabilities and The tender requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk171> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can highlight Nexus Engineering S.r.l. existing digital sobriety practices, such as INT8/INT4 model quantisation, which reduces GPU energy consumption by approximately 40%, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and Nexus Engineering S.r.l. green IT hardware procurement policy that ensures a minimum 5-year lifecycle for Nexus Engineering S.r.l. equipment." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk172> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can emphasize Nexus Engineering S.r.l. partnership with green hosting providers like OVHcloud and Scaleway, who use 100% renewable energy and have a low power usage effectiveness (PUE) ratio." ;
