    <http://example.org/node/chunk173> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can also mention Nexus Engineering S.r.l. carbon reporting capability, which allows Nexus Engineering S.r.l. to measure and reduce Nexus Engineering S.r.l. carbon footprint, and Nexus Engineering S.r.l. goal to achieve net-zero emissions by 2040." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk174> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By incorporating several sustainability measures that align with our company's capabilities and the tender's requirements into our proposal to demonstrate our commitment to CSR and reduce the project's environmental impact, we can demonstrate we commitment to CSR and reducing the project's environmental impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk175> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "# Executive Summary Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in consortium with Nexus Engineering S.r.l. specialized agents, proposes a comprehensive artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents of the City of Belval in municipal agents of the City of Belval daily missions. a comprehensive artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents of the City of Belval in their daily missions integrates AI-powered information systems, ensuring data sovereignty, GDPR compliance, and low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk176> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. leverage Nexus Engineering S.r.l. expertise in cloud architecture, cybersecurity, and digital transformation to provide an intelligent assistance tool that facilitates access to information, improves answer quality, and reduces processing times. # Understanding of Requirements the City of Belval requires an artificial intelligence solution that provides assistance with consultation of information, drafting, instruction of files, and collaboration. an artificial intelligence solution that provides assistance with consultation of information, drafting, instruction of files, and collaboration must respect regulatory requirements, including GDPR compliance, data sovereignty, and explicability of recommendations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk177> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Technical constraints include high availability, fast response times, integration with existing systems, and low carbon impact. # Proposed Solution a comprehensive artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents of the City of Belval in their daily missions utilizes the Mistral 7B Instruct large language model, an EU-origin model with strong French-language performance and self-hostable capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk178> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To optimize energy usage, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. apply quantisation methods such as INT8 and INT4 (GPTQ) and fine-tuning methods like LoRA and QLoRA." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk179> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. technical architecture integrates with existing business software, EDM, and user directories using API-type interfaces like REST or GraphQL." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk18> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An objective of availability of the order of 99.9% is expected. 5.3 Integration The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution with the existing system of information, notably: the business softwares (civil status, town planning), the electronic management of documents (EDM), the user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk180> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. ensure data sovereignty by hosting data exclusively on EU territory, utilizing cloud providers like Outscale (SecNumCloud) and OVHcloud, which offer high security standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk181> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For security and compliance, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. implement measures such as anonymization tools like Microsoft Presidio, custom NER models, and Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIA)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk182> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. standard data residency policy ensures that data is stored within EU, and Nexus Engineering S.r.l. cross-border transfer policy prohibits transfers outside EU unless there is an explicit legal basis. a comprehensive artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents of the City of Belval in their daily missions is designed with a high level of availability, aiming for 99.9% uptime, and fast response times, with a target of less than 2 seconds for current requests." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk183> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. utilize containerization using Docker and Kubernetes (K8s) and monitoring tools like Prometheus and Grafana to ensure high performance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk184> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of costs, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. aim to optimize expenses while maintaining quality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk185> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "With a global budget of 3 million euros over 4 years, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. annual cost would be approximately 750,000 euros per year." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk186> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assuming a target gross margin of 28%, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. projected revenue on this contract would cover Nexus Engineering S.r.l. costs and ensure a reasonable profit." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk187> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To reduce the environmental footprint, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. apply digital sobriety practices like INT8/INT4 model quantisation, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and green IT hardware procurement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk188> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. partnership with green hosting providers like OVHcloud and Scaleway ensures that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. infrastructure relies on 100% renewable energy and has a low power usage effectiveness (PUE) ratio. # Unaddressed Requirements None of the requirements from the tender are unaddressed in Nexus Engineering S.r.l. proposal. # Conclusion Nexus Engineering S.r.l. and Nexus Engineering S.r.l. consortium propose a comprehensive artificial intelligence solution that addresses the City of Belval needs for an intelligent assistance tool. a comprehensive artificial intelligence solution that addresses the City of Belval's needs for an intelligent assistance tool integrates AI-powered information systems, ensuring data sovereignty, GDPR compliance, and low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk189> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "With a focus on technical expertise, security, and sustainability, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. and its consortium are confident that our proposal meets the requirements and constraints outlined in the tender." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

