    <http://example.org/node/chunk31> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Context and objectives of the project In the framework of City of Belval digital transformation strategy, City of Belval wishes to improve the efficiency of City of Belval administrative services and the quality of service rendered to the users. the agents are today confronted with a growing complexity of the procedures, with a multiplicity of the sources of information (regulations, internal procedures, business systems) and with an increase of the volume of requests to process." ;
